%%% note
由来: https://docs.mulesoft.com/dataweave/2.11/dw-core-functions-plusplus (関数ページ)
doc と相違 (表記のみ: 引用符・括弧・書式の違いで、値は同じ)
doc の Output:
  { "DateTime": "2003-10-01T23:57:59-03:00 }
%%% script
%dw 2.0
output application/json
---
{ "DateTime" : (|2003-10-01T23:57:59| ++ |-03:00|) }
%%% output application/json
{
  "DateTime": "2003-10-01T23:57:59-03:00"
}
